database/data/nike-multiview-demo.json records each product's source page, Nike style-colour code, and four linked images from that same product page. Images are external links served by static.nike.com; this repository does not store or grant rights to them. Use for this classroom demonstration only and review Nike's terms before any other use.

The names identify the photographed products. Display prices, sizes, supplier and inventory are demo data; Cena Store is not represented as an authorized Nike retailer. Photo availability depends on Nike's remote image service.
